#   solution    : "Configure the aaa authentication for enable access using the TACACS+ server-group as primary method and the local database as backup method hostname(config)# aaa authentication enable console <server-group_name> local Default Value: The aaa authentication is disabled by default for the enable mode"
#   reference   : "NIST 800-53r5|AC-18 AC-18(1) AC-18(3) CM-2 CM-6 CM-7 CM-7(1) CM-9"
