#   info        : "Verifies for digitally signed images that the running image is from a trusted source Rationale: The software image being a code can be vulnerable to many attacks such as malicious code injection in the software, the modification of the code installed in the ROM."
#   solution    : "Step 1: Correct the errors on the hardware and software Step 2: Run the audit procedure until the system is compliant Step 3: Implement secure delivery of hardware and harden the software distribution server"
#   reference   : "NIST 800-53r5|AC-18 AC-18(1) AC-18(3) CM-2 CM-6 CM-7 CM-7(1) CM-9"
#   see_also    : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
